	(text "External source: 4.75-5.25 V; total board + load <=500 mA near 23 C.\nNo PD negotiation or current-advertisement detector.\nTwo independent 5.1 kOhm Rd resistors; data / SBU unused."
		(at 22.86 166.82 0)
		(effects
