	)
	(text "F1: 0.75 A hold / 1.50 A trip at 23 C (not a 500 mA limiter).\nD1: 6 V standoff; up to 10.3 V clamp at rated pulse.\nTVS is NOT 5 V overvoltage protection for sensitive loads."
